    unit: "Fault Tolerance",
    question:
      "a) What is fault tolerance in distributed systems? Explain two techniques used to achieve it. [10 Marks]\nb) A bank implements a distributed transaction system for handling money transfers between branches. Draw a UML Sequence Diagram to illustrate how a transaction is initiated, processed, and confirmed across multiple servers. [10 Marks]",
    points: [
      "Fault tolerance definition",
      "Redundancy techniques",
      "Replication",
      "Distributed transactions",
      "Two-phase commit",
    ],
